# A comparison's result inside a tuple stays a condition when the tuple
# is bound at the top level (T1, ask G19): a later use decides whether
# it is a number or a truth value, as for a bare condition.
== SOURCE
u:n_um := { (a, m) -> 0 + m }
u:n_ew := { z -> (z, 0 < 1 2 3) }
s := u:n_ew 5
u:n_um s
== RESULT
1 1 1
